     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Describing a person",
     "texto": [
      "The adjective agrees with the noun: **jasne oczy**, but **jasna koszula**. Polish marks gender and number in this agreement.",
      "**Uroda** means «beauty» or «physical attractiveness»; it does not mean «ugly». For «ugly» one says brzydki or brzydka."
